  3
NOTES - DRAFT 0.2.2 (OPTION C2)\P1. Units mm. Room sizes are CLEAR INTERNAL (finished face to finished face); overall dimensions are EXTERNAL. GIA per dwelling 104.13 m2 (NDSS para 8: internal faces of perimeter walls, incl. partitions). Building foo
  3
tprint 18.60 x 12.30 m = 228.78 m2. Dwelling B mirrors dwelling A about the party-wall centreline.\P2. Accessibility target M4(2) - an optional requirement that applies only where a planning condition requires it (ADM Vol 1 para 0.3). Bathroom A: bat
  3
h, WC and basin to ADM Diagram 2.5 with provision for a future level-access shower at the bath position; bathroom door opens outward (2.27d). Living-room principal window sill max 850 mm (2.24c). Conservatory door 1,000 opening (approx. 850 clear). D
  3
raft 0.2.2: Bedroom 1 and 2 entries are double doors (900 + 500 leaves) facing each other across the hall; store opening 1,600 with bypass panels; kitchen-utility pocket sliding door, 850 opening. Door sizes subject to a door schedule.\P3. Ventilatio
  3
n: MVHR (ADF 2021 paras 1.67-1.73). Unit allowance in utility/plant; duct routes TBD (roof not designed). Purge ventilation by openable windows and the rooflight.\P4. Rooflight over living/dining approx. 1.0 m2 net glazing, openable, solar-control gl
  3
azing and external blind. Size and position subject to daylight (BS EN 17037) and overheating (ADO / TM59) assessment.\P5. Food storage: tall larder units in the kitchen (no walk-in pantry).\P6. PROVISIONAL (not yet supported by evidence): wall build
  3
-ups 300/200/100; orientation (north assumed); conservatory outline (S-08 basis; revised in Draft 0.2.2 to 2.6 x 1.5 m with 300 mm chamfers); porches, patios, 1.5 m paths and all external works. Site boundary NOT SHOWN (no survey). Battery storage lo
  3
cation NOT SHOWN.\P7. Concept drawing only. Geometry tested by script; NOT a planning, Building Regulations (Parts B, E, F, K, L, M, O) or fire-safety compliance claim. Professional review required.\P8. Draft 0.1 is retained unchanged (MMUCO_ORION_Du
  1
plex_Floor_Plan.dxf).
