  1
athroom (A): 3.20 x 2.50 m = 8.00 m2\PUtility and plant: 2.50 x 2.00 m = 5.00 m2\PStore: 1.40 x 2.00 m = 2.80 m2\PHall: 1.50 x 6.60 m = 9.90 m2\PNIFA 100.10 + partitions 4.03 = GIA 104.13 m2\PTwo dwellings: GIA 208.26 m2; footprint 228.78 m2
